#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0274 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "DOSAEONU is not declared on the dataset. Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule on the presence of the pair, so with the unit half absent the rule never executes - asserted as skipped, not borrowed as noViolation. The two rows carry a populated DOSEAEON, i.e. data that would fire if the rule ran."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col DOSEAEON type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE |  50
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA   | 100
